I need to widen the filter to also catch Haiku 4.5, Sonnet 4.5, Sonnet 5, GPT-5.6/OpenAI, Titan Embed, and Llama 3 8B, plus carry forward the long NextToken verbatim since page one's filter already covered its relevant entries.

"}], "parent_id": "71eadb7a-b576-46a7-8eb5-e001c442991f"}

